		{
			description: [
				"In &2GregTech&r, the ways to produce power are quite different from each other, and each of them has its own progression. Each new tier usually brings a way to enhance your power production along a certain path. In &2TerraFirmaGreg&r, you have three main paths of progression: &dSteam,&r &9Combustion&r and &bGas,&r each with its own &apros&r and &ccons&r.\\n\\nDon't try to look for the best one, because &6it does not exist&r. Some will be &6cheaper&r material-wise, while others will require &6complex processing&r to make their fuels but can be easy to expand.\\n\\nIn this chapter, you will find all the information you need about the &6advantages&r and &6disadvantages&r of each path. It is also important to remember that nothing is set in stone: you could switch to a different power generation method, or even use a bit of all of them.\\n\\nBut it does not stop here: on every new &2celestial body&r you explore, you will discover a local way to produce power."
				"{@pagebreak}"
			]
